{"id":"5639c532f6329124","group":"58","path":"58/batch10/58-df-brauer-group.md","title":"Brauer Group","display":"df-brauer-group — Brauer Group","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-brauer-group","aliases":["58-df-brauer-group","Brauer Group"],"display":"df-brauer-group — Brauer Group","depends_on":["[[../batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md]]","[[../batch04/58-df-tensor.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-brauer-group"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-brauer-group</span><span>Brauer Group</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-brauer-group — Brauer Group"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"10d54928fc77535a\" href=\"?note=10d54928fc77535a\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md\">../batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"9bf75150bce95ccc\" href=\"?note=9bf75150bce95ccc\" title=\"../batch04/58-df-tensor.md\">../batch04/58-df-tensor.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k,A,B,G,\\mathcal A_k\\in V\">\\(k,A,B,G,\\mathcal A_k\\in V\\)</span>, where <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal A_k\">\\(\\mathcal A_k\\)</span> is a fixed set of codes for finite-dimensional <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-algebras.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> (from <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"10d54928fc77535a\" href=\"?note=10d54928fc77535a\" title=\"../batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md\">../batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md</a>).</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\cong_{k\\text{-alg}}\">\\(\\cong_{k\\text{-alg}}\\)</span> denotes isomorphism of unital <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"k\">\\(k\\)</span>-algebras.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrauerEquivalent}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrauerEquivalent}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span> and <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BrauerGroup}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{BrauerGroup}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BrauerEquivalent}_S(A,B,k)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\land\n\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(B,k)\\land\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\nM_m(A)\\cong_{k\\text{-alg}}M_n(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BrauerEquivalent}_S(A,B,k)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\land\n\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(B,k)\\land\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\nM_m(A)\\cong_{k\\text{-alg}}M_n(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BrauerGroup}_S(G,k,\\mathcal A_k)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG=\\left\\{[A]_{\\mathrm{BrauerEquivalent}_S(-,-,k)}:\nA\\in\\mathcal A_k\\land\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\right\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BrauerGroup}_S(G,k,\\mathcal A_k)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG=\\left\\{[A]_{\\mathrm{BrauerEquivalent}_S(-,-,k)}:\nA\\in\\mathcal A_k\\land\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\right\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}multiplication}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\land\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(B,k)\n\\to [A]\\cdot[B]\\coloneqq[A\\otimes_kB].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}multiplication}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\land\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(B,k)\n\\to [A]\\cdot[B]\\coloneqq[A\\otimes_kB].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>The base field is an argument of Brauer equivalence; omitting it makes matrix-algebra isomorphism ambiguous.</li>\n<li>The set of algebra codes prevents an illicit quotient of a proper class. Tensor product gives a well-defined operation on equivalence classes.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Reference\">[Reference]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>Gille and Szamuely, Central Simple Algebras and Galois Cohomology</li>\n<li>Serre, Local Fields</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2},{"id":"Reference","text":"[Reference]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"../batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"10d54928fc77535a","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch04/58-df-tensor.md","status":"resolved","id":"9bf75150bce95ccc","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch04/58-df-tensor.md]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md","status":"resolved","id":"10d54928fc77535a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}$ (from [[../batch12/58-df-central-simple-algebra.md]]).","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"k,A,B,G,\\mathcal A_k\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal A_k","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S:V^2\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\cong_{k\\text{-alg}}","display":false},{"tex":"k","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrauerEquivalent}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{BrauerGroup}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}equivalence}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BrauerEquivalent}_S(A,B,k)\n\\leftrightarrow\n\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\land\n\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(B,k)\\land\n\\exists m,n\\in\\omega\\setminus\\{0\\}\\;\nM_m(A)\\cong_{k\\text{-alg}}M_n(B).","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}group}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{BrauerGroup}_S(G,k,\\mathcal A_k)\n\\leftrightarrow\nG=\\left\\{[A]_{\\mathrm{BrauerEquivalent}_S(-,-,k)}:\nA\\in\\mathcal A_k\\land\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\right\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}brauer\\text{-}multiplication}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(A,k)\\land\\mathrm{CentralSimpleAlgebra}_S(B,k)\n\\to [A]\\cdot[B]\\coloneqq[A\\otimes_kB].","display":true}],"bytes":1787,"backlinks":[{"id":"a11585cba9c21cfd","anchor":"ref-244","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[58-df-brauer-group]]"},{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-214","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch10/58-df-brauer-group.md|58-df-brauer-group]]（batch10）"}],"outgoing":["10d54928fc77535a","9bf75150bce95ccc"]}